v 3
d cdid: chained and ordinary difference-in-differences for Stata
d Version 1.0.0.0. Requires Stata 19.5 (StataNow) or later.
d Estimates group-time average treatment effects under staggered adoption in complete and incomplete panels,
d and effects of a binary treatment with entry and exit
d (Bellégo, Benatia and Dortet-Bernadet 2025; Callaway and Sant'Anna 2021). Reference implementation: R cdid 1.3.0.0.
d Ordinary mode requires csdid 2.0.2, distributed in the csdid folder and installed separately.
d License: GPL-3 (see LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
